OL,3,GNEWSAFour arrested after two men
OL,4,Ainjured in stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been arrested after
OL,7,Ftwo men were found injured following a
OL,8,Freported assault, police have said.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police said officers
OL,11,Ffound a man seriously injured on Temple
OL,12,FStreet, in Bristol, at about 07:39 GMT.
OL,13,FA second man was found injured inside a
OL,14,Fnearby flat.
OL,16,FTwo men and two women have been
OL,17,Farrested on suspicion of wounding with
OL,18,Fintent.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
